# Build output
build/
.gradle/

# Local Gradle distribution (130MB, re-downloadable via tools/ bootstrap)
tools/gradle-*/
tools/gradle.zip

# Capture history: keep the contact sheets, drop the individual frames.
# Contact sheets are what progress.html embeds and what reviews are argued
# from, so the iteration-to-iteration comparison the brief asks for is fully
# preserved. Individual full-res frames are working artefacts for close
# inspection during a single pass and lose their value once that pass is
# judged -- and they are 55MB per ~100 frames, which would reach gigabytes
# over the number of passes this project expects.
#
# The exception is the handful of frames progress.html *embeds*. Those are in the
# same category as the contact sheets and must be force-added (`git add -f`), which
# tools/check-progress.mjs now enforces -- it asks git what is published rather than
# asking this disk what exists. Seven of them were broken images for every reader
# but the author before that check existed.
out/**/frame_*.png

# Stray class files from ad-hoc javac runs
*.class

# Regenerable analysis output
out/timing/
out/tmp/

# Python bytecode from the tile generators
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local agent/session settings
.claude/
